  CPU: 5 UID: 1000 PID: 3442 Comm: a Not tainted 7.0.0-30-generic #30-Ubuntu PREEMPT(lazy)
  RIP: 0010:rcu_note_context_switch+0x238/0x2a0
  Call Trace:
   <TASK>
